@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Welcome to the Database Profiler</h1>
</div>

<p>Start by making a connection.</p>

<p>Then select a database.</p>

<p>After selecting a database, you will be able select specific tables, views, stored procedures or functions.</p>

<p>Column schema and profile data (for a selected table) can be viewed or exported in a report.</p>

<p>Views, stored procedures and functions can be viewed or exported in a script.</p>

<p>Five reports are available:</p>
<ol>
    <li>Excel Report on the Selected Database</li>
    <li>Excel Report on Tables</li>
    <li>Excel Report on Relationships</li>
    <li>Entity Relationship Diagram</li>
    <li>Script Report</li>
</ol>

